Lunduke's Linux Kernel (lunduke-linux-kernel)
=============================================

Optional LCOS overlay metapackage. Pulls linux-image-7.2.6-lunduke and
recommends matching headers. After install, reboot and pick the
7.2.6-lunduke entry in GRUB (or set it once); the Devuan kernel remains
installed.

  sudo apt update
  sudo apt install lunduke-linux-kernel
